{"study_accession":"PRJNA396725","secondary_study_accession":"SRP114505","title":"Differential expression of long non‑coding RNA and mRNA in children with Henoch‑Schönlein purpura nephritis","description":"Long non‑coding RNAs (lncRNAs) serve an essential role in regulating immunological functions. However, their impact on Henoch‑Schönlein purpura nephritis (HSPN), has remained elusive. Overall design: The present study determined the expression of lncRNAs and mRNAs in the peripheral blood of 6 children with HSPN and recruited 4 healthy children for comparative study. High‑throughput sequencing revealed outstanding differences in lncRNA and mRNA expression, which were verified through reverse transcription‑quantitative polymerase chain reaction. Gene Ontology and Kyoto Encyclopedia of Genes and Genomes pathway analyses were used to investigate the associated biological functions and possible mechanisms of lncRNAs and mRNAs in HSPN.","pubmed":"30651843","geo_series":"","n_samples":10,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN07431176","study_accession":"PRJNA396725","blood_class":"whole_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"Sick_105","description":"Sick_105","sex":"male","geo_sample":"GSM2724042","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2018-12-07","attributes":[["source_name","the whole blood"],["diagnosis","Henoch-Schonlein Purpura Nephritis"],["tissue","whole blood"],["age","10 years"],["sex","male"],["course of hspn","34 months"],["type of hspn","isolated proteinuria"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR5886342","experiment_accession":"SRX3052254","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina HiSeq 2000","read_count":26827640,"base_count":8048292000,"first_public":"2018-12-07","experiment_title":"Illumina HiSeq 2000 sequencing: GSM2724042: Sick_105 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[],"single_cell":false},{"sample_accession":"SAMN07431177","study_accession":"PRJNA396725","blood_class":"whole_blood","class_from":"sample","title